{"speciesId":897,"names":{"fr":"Spectreval","es":"Spectrier","en":"Spectrier","ja":"レイスポス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se sert de tous ses sens pour se repérer, sauf celui de la vue. Un coup de ses sabots suffirait à séparer l’âme du corps de sa cible."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Examina su entorno con todos los sentidos, salvo la vista. Se dice que sus coces son capaces de robarle el alma a quien las recibe."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It probes its surroundings with all its senses save one—it doesn’t use its sense of sight. Spectrier’s kicks are said to separate soul from body."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"視覚 以外の 五感を 使い 様子を 探る。 蹴られたものは 魂を 抜かれてしまうという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon friand de silence et de solitude galope à travers les ténèbres nocturnes et aspire l’énergie vitale des êtres endormis."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Amante de la quietud y la soledad, galopa por las tinieblas nocturnas absorbiendo la energía vital de toda criatura que esté durmiendo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"As it dashes through the night, Spectrier absorbs the life-force of sleeping creatures. It craves silence and solitude."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"闇夜を 駆けぬけ 寝ているものの 生命エネルギーを 吸い取る。 孤独と 静寂を 好む。"}],"varieties":[{"id":897,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[20,"level-up",18],[25,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[20,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[20,"level-up",42],[25,"level-up",42],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[20,"level-up",54],[25,"level-up",54]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[20,"level-up",66],[25,"level-up",66],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"disable","learns"